Cell["5. Exact regulated hard functional", "Section"],

Cell["In units k34/2=1 and k12/2=r, the two cross-edge differences are tau2-tau3=z3-z2/r and tau4-tau1=z1/r-z4. The physical definition is the original i-epsilon integral with endpoints extended and damping removed after SK summation. No prescription subtracting Laurent poles is assumed. The formal expression below is available for inspecting individual rows and numerical-backend comparisons; production evaluation uses matrix quadrature.", "Text"],

