Cell["7. Amplitudes and convergence diagnostics", "Section"],

Cell["antiAtMass evaluates every amplitude at one positive mass. AP=0 is the theoretical value; APResidual is computed independently before imposing parity. Check the residual and vary mesh resolution, late-time cutoff, early-time range, and damping before interpreting the output as the physical limit. The routine neither discards divergent terms nor assumes that a finite regulated number proves convergence.", "Text"],

